      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a preliminary risk assessment for some long-term commercial real estate investments in the Westside district. The neighborhood has been seeing a lot of rapid demographic turnover and new immigrant communities moving in lately. From an actuarial standpoint, what kind of social or community-level indicators should I be looking at to gauge the long-term stability of an area like that?",
