      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To incorporate these observed patterns methodologically, you should utilize socioeconomic proxy variables rather than the demographics themselves. Focus on indicators correlated with economic stability, such as local educational attainment levels, market wage trends, or the ratio of rental to owner-occupied units across different sub-sections of the neighborhood. This approach allows the model to capture the *impact* of community structure on asset performance without relying on potentially biased demographic categorization as the primary driver.",
